    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Gawaá adoorihe AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng sla'aak, nee alqaduuwós oohaak umuú deelooro, nee hara'ayarose harmagahhaak, nee kaahirose nee dabeerose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaangwí ló'wa aldakutaak, asma na/iihúng kaangwí ngu xuiaaká, laqaá muxtár Mungú nga ari'iiká, nee aleesleemuwose nee /uuruuwose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee layuudá' nee waa/oo/amoodae tidá' aa baraá yaamaá Misrír wa tleéhh dír waawutmo Farao oo Misri nee yaamuuwós sleémeero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoodá' inslawaak aa tleéhh dír slaqwaruusér Misri, farsuuín nee garduuín kudaá slaqwara, nee adoodá' slaqwaruuser'ín tidá' kuungá' naa eehat ngira hhaamiís baraá tlawtá Shamu, adór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ngira hhaamiís, tam ay laarí. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee sleeme inslawaak adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ nay tleéhh qoomaadá' tawa baraá xaanxáy kahha', qoomaadá' tawa hardati'iiká, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee muruudá' sleémeero aa tleéhh dír Datani nee Abiramu, daaqoó Eliabu, garmoó Reubeni, adoodá' yaamu nira afa nguri awaatliyé' dír geeraá múk Israeli sleémeero wa ale, nee mukdá' sleémeero nguri gu/iyé', nee heemaduuine, nee hikwaaín, nee sagadiyuuser'ín sleémeero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma ilahunge tlehhmi'iikaá uren sleémeero awa waa/oo/amo awa adór kuká' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aa tleéhh iga aandé'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Hara'ayduuká' sleémeero laarí nuy hara'ayiim iialooeesaak, as daqaní /uuru kuwa sleera' oo tawa data' baraá yaamuudá' ta keera' as kiwa ala'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daqaní slafíngw tleér u sleerá' baraá yaamaá hatsá' dihhooár ilwa nee dane, yaamuudá' aáng AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aa lo'ór wa /aáy ngiwa haniisi dír baabi'iihúng nee xwaylar'ín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma yaamuudá' ti hotaá eera' a adór yaamaá Misriroká, kudá' ta dahha', kudá' handá' balaangw una dahaasiindé', nee ma'aay kiri wa/amisé' ar ya'aahúng adór asalmoó naanú. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala yaamaá tay hotaá eera' a yaamaá tlom'i nee xatso, ma'aay baraá yaamuudae adór kir slay a tluwoó dooraá daáhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamuudá' an yaamaá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng i amohhe'eemiisi. Umuú daqto gin ga/áy, iimír iimu/úngw kuru ay tam alhhe'eesoó kuru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Naagáy kuungá' hara'ayduueé' kuká' laarí ni hanmiis bira iialooesé', nee AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng bura slaé', nee bura sagadiyusé' ar munerhúng sleémeero, nee qeereemoohúng sleémeero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' bar adoorí aga tlehhé', daqaní inós tluwaay ngu haniis baraá yaamuuhúng qoomaadá' hariima, tluwoó saxi, nee tluwoó buhaare, kuungá' balangwhúng kuri bu'uundá', nee difaái nee di/tahunge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós gitso ngi duux baraá qamuhunge as hikwaahúng, kuungá' tari /ayiindá', tari axá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ti ló'wa harmagahhe' munerhúng makawa al/aáy, nee tari warqeerá' munguaá hatlá' kiri sagadiyusá' nee kiri sluufmisuú eerá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma adoosíng bara tlehhé', AAKOÓ MUNGÚ buhhtaawo nuri i daa/atúy, aluuwo doori giri tseek tluwaay guri ilaa/, nee yaamu balaangw ngway hamareesiaaká. Kuungá' tari hhaandá' baraá yaamaá hhoohhoo', kudá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ naa haniís.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Axweesantí baraá munerhúng ti qase', nee baraá qeereemoohúng. /Aymi'iiká' tseegaak gawaá dabaahúng i ale, adór laya, nee ki dahasá' gawaá gitsee/erhúng, as tawa gár kuungá' nu inslawtamis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na/iihúng /aymi'iikae intsaahhatamisaak qoomár bar marií wa iwiwitá', bar hi'iimitá', nee qoomár bar qatuú eerá', nee qoomár qatuuwo bar tlatleerá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gooimaak gawaá nahhtá marayhúng, nee gooimaak gawaá afér marayhúng, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "as kuungá' nee na/iihunge hotaá tleerá' kiwa sleera' baraá yaamaá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng aa lo'ór wa /aáy ngiwa haniisi dír baabi'iihúng, deelo sleémeero ar doori iwa hootiia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Kuungá' ti harmagahhe', hara'ayar'eé' sleémeero ar naa kuungií hara'ayiím kawa ota' ar ilakaahara. AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng sla'aak, nee adoodá' inós i kaahi sleémeero kawa ota', nee tawa alhota' nee inós. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daqaní AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, xoordu sleémeero gi geeraahúng wa guus, kuungá' aalír xoorduudá' /uureemaá koomá' ta kuungae kari hayota'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuú dír ta adata' ya'ahunge a yaamuuhúng, iimu/úngw digimuú yaamuuhúng a iimír xaanxáy wa tleemu bihhaá basko, tay bihhaá tloomár Lebanoni bihhaá /iiko, iimír yaaér Eufrate wa tleemu bihhaá da/aawe, ay Tlawtá Tla/aangw bihhaá /uwawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heé kuungá' nu tlampa'aás i kaahh tumu wák. Umuú dír ta keera'a baraá yaamuwo AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng muu gu dae tsaat, adoodá' inós ngira oó'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Ti ló'wa harmagahhe', aníng laarír kilae tsuuqa nee lo'o ngi qaás dír geeraahúng. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsuuqa a kuká': Barnaxes hara'ayár AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng tí laarí nu babaw aga iialooesé', tsuuqa i sleerá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' tundu lu'us bar hara'ayár AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng aga iialooesi'iiká, nee loohidá' inós naa ooi, tari munguaá hatlá' sluufmisuú eerá', kudá' kuungá' ta xua'aaká, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ barnaxes naa hardahaás baraá yaamuudá' ta aalír eera', tsuuqa kiri ilahanisá' gawaá tloomár Gerisimu nee lu'umis kuri ilahanisá' gawaá tloomár Ebali wa ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tlom'iiká' i gayuú yaaér Yordani, bihhaá /uwa awa loohidá' aa da/aá xu', baraá yaamaá múk Kana'ani kuduú yaamaá Arabár hoót, kudá' nee yaamaá Gilgali ti ga/aawá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' yaaér Yordani an waarahhá' tari datá' yaamuudá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng naa haniís. Naagáy kuungá' yaamuudá' kiri alá' tari baraadá' wa hotá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ti ló'wa harmagahhe' kaahi nee hara'ayaro sleémeero boo/esa' ar ilakaahara, nee tidá' aa oó' handá' aníng laarí nga dirhúng i qaás.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.32"
            ]
          }
        }
